      "content": "Thanks. That's a good start. I'm finding that most of the foundational literature seems to lean heavily into those stabilizing functions. Could you go into more detail on the specific mechanisms—like how ritual and shared belief systems actually translate into long-term stability in local communities? It would be helpful to have a more robust breakdown of those positive sociological drivers for my report.",
